(38200: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: Only%20the%20existing%20JavaScript%20dependencies%20are%0Ashared.%20Cargo%20runs%20offline%20and%20locked%20with%20one%20job%20in%20a%20fresh%20target%20directory.%0AThe%20existing%20checksum-verifying%20downloader%20acquires%20only%20the%20frozen%20registry%27s%0Anative%20oracle%20build%20assets%20into%20that%20scratch%20overlay%20under%20a%20separate%20ninety%0Asecond%20bound.%20The%20artifact%20receipt%20records%20the%20exact%20registry%2C%20downloader%20and%0Aacquired%20compressed%2Fdecoded%20source%20hashes.%20External%20grammars%20remain%20untracked.%0ACompilation%20has%20a%20fifteen%20minute%20bound%3B%20probe%20execution%20has%20a%20sixty%20second%20bound.%0AEach%20process%20uses%20its%20own%20Linux%20process%20group%20and%20retains%20at%20most%20eight%20MiB%0Aper%20diagnostic%20stream.%20Artifacts%20retain%20the%20oracle%2C%20source%20inventory%2C%20tool%0Aversions%2C%20native%20report%20when%20produced%20and%20every%20process%20result%20after%20failures.%0A%0AThis%20is%20finite%20baseline%20candidate%20evidence.%20It%20makes%20no%20claim%20about%20current%0Aproduction%20APIs%2C%20default%20CST%20transport%2C%20arbitrary%20depth%2C%20container%20identity%20or%0Aledger%20obligations.%20See%20the%20%5Bauthoritative%20vision%5D%28..%2F..%2F..%2F..%2Fdocs%2Fvision.md%29.%0A%0A%23%23%20Compiler%20and%20target%20observations%0A%0AThe%20source-only%20planner%20derives%20one%20additive%20%60std%3A%3Aprimitive%3A%3Ausize%3A%3ABITS%60%0Aobservation%20in%20the%20existing%20post-assertion%20native%20report.%20Its%20source%20receipt%0Arestores%20the%20complete%20original%20probe%20exactly.%20It%20does%20not%20execute%20the%20constant%0Alocally%20or%20change%20any%20original%20case%20or%20assertion.%0A%0ANative%20CI%20retains%20verbose%20compiler%20diagnostics%20and%20binds%20the%20selected%20probe%27s%0Aactual%20%60--extern%20serde_json%3D...%60%20argument%20to%20its%20exact%20compiler-artifact%20record.%0AThe%20same%20locked%20package%20can%20have%20several%20feature%20units%3B%20their%20feature%20sets%20are%0Anever%20combined.%20The%20collector%20checks%20complete%20build%20output%2C%20original%20stream%0Ahashes%2C%20source%20and%20executable%20paths%20and%20explicit%20version%20bounds%3A%20Cargo%20and%20the%0Aactually%20selected%20Rust%20compiler%0A%60%3E%3D1.90.0%20%3C1.100.0%60%2C%20JSON%20dependency%20%60%3E%3D1.0.151%20%3C1.0.152) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
